    L["Help: /who Mode"] = "Ayuda: Modo de /who"
    L["Controls how manual /who responses are captured silently without interrupting your gameplay."] = "Controla como se capturan las consultas manuales de /who en silencio sin interrumpir."
    L["Choose 'Silent UI' (hides Blizzard Friends popup outside combat) or 'Chat Filter' (parses chat lines cleanly without touching FriendsFrame)."] = "Elige 'UI Silenciosa' (oculta Amigos fuera de combate) o 'Filtro de Chat' (lee el chat sin tocar FriendsFrame)."
    L["Help: /who Cooldown"] = "Ayuda: Espera de /who"
